    - <i>This disturbance you bring to my altar...</i>
    - <i>I was sleeping! Waaa! But that devilish aroma woke me up... mmmm... grrr...</i>
    - <i>Hear me, legged creature! For I have made a decision...</i>
    - <i>In different circumstances, I would kill you for ruining my nap... but you
      may be of use to me.</i>
    - <i>Prove your worth to me, here and now, small thing! Or you will die in this
      place... mwahaha!</i>
